                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.4.35"&gt;3.4.35&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLUSTER SLOT-STATS (8.2): per-slot usage statistics on IServer, experimental SER012 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6257840417" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3341" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3341/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3341"&gt;#3341&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check the maximum operation count in HeartbeatConsistencyCheckPingsAsync by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/unsafePtr/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/unsafePtr"&gt;@unsafePtr&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6287335585" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3342" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3342/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3342"&gt;#3342&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Links follow the org move to seredis (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6138124037" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3326" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3326/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3326"&gt;#3326&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6290325772" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3344" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3344/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3344"&gt;#3344&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MOVING handoff: hold new work in the backlog while the in-flight commands drain, so the recycle happens within a round trip instead of at the window end by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6326663598" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3347" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3347/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3347"&gt;#3347&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/unsafePtr/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/unsafePtr"&gt;@unsafePtr&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6287335585" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3342" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3342/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3342"&gt;#3342&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/compare/3.4.31...3.4.35"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;3.4.31...3.4.35&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
