                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/4.0.161-alpha"&gt;4.0.161-alpha&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;v4: a close with commands in flight no longer completes a call with another call's reply (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6150672157" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3329"&gt;#3329&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6153237114" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3332" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3332/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3332"&gt;#3332&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LATENCY RESET and CLIENT TRACKING write through IRespArgument operands, and RenderedArgs goes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6140761419" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3327" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3327/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3327"&gt;#3327&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The coverage audit sees v4's RespLiterals fragments and ignores the connection core; CLIENT SETNAME/SETINFO get ledger rows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6145622751" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3328" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3328/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3328"&gt;#3328&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;v4: cache hits reuse the deserialized result for provably-shareable types by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6345993438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3349" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3349/hovercard" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3349"&gt;#3349&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/seredis/StackExchange.Redis/compare/4.0.155-alpha...4.0.161-alpha"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;4.0.155-alpha...4.0.161-alpha&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
